  "title": "Day 1",
  "sents": [
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "You're two minutes late",
      "zh": "你迟到了两分钟",
      "a": "audio/luca_d01o/s01.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s01.mp3",
      "d": 1.61
    },
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "Was there a boat? Huh?",
      "zh": "有船经过吗",
      "a": "audio/luca_d01o/s02.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s02.mp3",
      "d": 1.2
    },
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "Did you hide?",
      "zh": "你躲起来了吗",
      "a": "audio/luca_d01o/s03.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s03.mp3",
      "d": 0.74
    },
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "Because if they catch even a glimpse of you...",
      "zh": "因为就算他们只瞄了你一眼...",
      "a": "audio/luca_d01o/s04.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s04.mp3",
      "d": 3.12
    },
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "You think they come around to meet new friends, huh?",
      "zh": "你觉得他们是出海来结交新朋友的吗",
      "a": "audio/luca_d01o/s05.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s05.mp3",
      "d": 1.8
    },
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "Make small talk",
      "zh": "聊聊天",
      "a": "audio/luca_d01o/s06.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s06.mp3",
      "d": 1.1
    },
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "I don't",
      "zh": "我没有",
      "a": "audio/luca_d01o/s07.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s07.mp3",
      "d": 0.96
    },
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "They're here to do murders",
      "zh": "他们是出来猎杀的",
      "a": "audio/luca_d01o/s08.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s08.mp3",
      "d": 1.73
    },
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "So, I'm just making sure you know",
      "zh": "我只是想让你明白",
      "a": "audio/luca_d01o/s09.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s09.mp3",
      "d": 1.85
    },
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "When I was a kid",
      "zh": "在我小时候",
      "a": "audio/luca_d01o/s10.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s10.mp3",
      "d": 0.74
    },
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "we'd go weeks without seeing a boat",
      "zh": "好几周都看不到一支船",
      "a": "audio/luca_d01o/s11.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s11.mp3",
      "d": 2.18
    },
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "and let me tell you",
      "zh": "而且我告诉你",
      "a": "audio/luca_d01o/s12.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s12.mp3",
      "d": 0.72
    },
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "they did not have motors",
      "zh": "那时船上还没有马达",
      "a": "audio/luca_d01o/s13.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s13.mp3",
      "d": 1.27
    },
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "Just a sweaty land monster with a paddle",
      "zh": "只有一个划着桨 汗流浃背的陆怪",
      "a": "audio/luca_d01o/s14.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s14.mp3",
      "d": 2.62
    },
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "Hi, grandma",
      "zh": "你好 外婆",
      "a": "audio/luca_d01o/s15.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s15.mp3",
      "d": 1.01
    },
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "Hey, bubble",
      "zh": "好啊 宝贝",
      "a": "audio/luca_d01o/s16.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s16.mp3",
      "d": 1.25
    },
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "Luca!",
      "zh": "卢卡",
      "a": "audio/luca_d01o/s17.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s17.mp3",
      "d": 0.94
    },
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "look at pinchy-pessa",
      "zh": "快看钳钳公主",
      "a": "audio/luca_d01o/s18.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s18.mp3",
      "d": 1.68
    },
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "She's molting",
      "zh": "她在换壳",
      "a": "audio/luca_d01o/s19.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s19.mp3",
      "d": 1.46
    },
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "Oh, it's magnificent",
      "zh": "真是太神奇了",
      "a": "audio/luca_d01o/s20.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s20.mp3",
      "d": 1.61
    },
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "Now",
      "zh": "现在",
      "a": "audio/luca_d01o/s21.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s21.mp3",
      "d": 0.67
    },
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "here's a champion show crab if I ever saw one",
      "zh": "这是我见过的最顶级的赛级蟹了",
      "a": "audio/luca_d01o/s22.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s22.mp3",
      "d": 3.12
    },
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "Oh, nice",
      "zh": "好耶",
      "a": "audio/luca_d01o/s23.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s23.mp3",
      "d": 1.01
    },
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "Don't look her in the eye!",
      "zh": "别跟她对视",
      "a": "audio/luca_d01o/s24.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s24.mp3",
      "d": 1.32
    },
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "Sorry",
      "zh": "抱歉",
      "a": "audio/luca_d01o/s25.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s25.mp3",
      "d": 0.46
    },
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "But don't apologize",
      "zh": "但也别道歉啊",
      "a": "audio/luca_d01o/s26.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s26.mp3",
      "d": 1.42
    },
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "She can sense weakness",
      "zh": "她能捕捉到你的软弱",
      "a": "audio/luca_d01o/s27.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s27.mp3",
      "d": 1.87
    },
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "Come eat, Luca",
      "zh": "来吃饭 卢卡",
      "a": "audio/luca_d01o/s28.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s28.mp3",
      "d": 1.25
    },
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "We better beat those Branzinos at the crab show this year",
      "zh": "我们最好在今年的螃蟹秀上打败那帮布兰奇鲈",
      "a": "audio/luca_d01o/s29.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s29.mp3",
      "d": 2.98
    },
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "Everyone thinks Bianca Branzino's so great",
      "zh": "所有人都觉得比安卡·布兰奇鲈很厉害",
