      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s30.mp3",
      "d": 3.02
    },
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "with her prize-winning crabs and amazing dolphin impression",
      "zh": "因为她有只奖杯收割机螃蟹 还很会模仿海豚",
      "a": "audio/luca_d01o/s31.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s31.mp3",
      "d": 3.89
    },
    {
      "sp": "",
      "t": "Please!",
      "zh": "拜托",
      "a": "audio/luca_d01o/s32.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/luca_d01o/s32.mp3",
